  "cn-626": {"name":"Travel Package Developer","summary":"Finds and scouts new destinations, plans routes and schedules, and turns them into travel packages.","tasks":["Scout and research new destinations","Plan travel routes and schedules","Advise customers and explain packages","Handle bookings and paperwork"],"msActions":["Plan a family trip yourself, including transport, lodging, and sights","Find a little-known spot in your town and make an introduction guide","Join a travel career experience at a youth center or a job world center"]},
