  "cn-915": {"name":"Sound Engineer","summary":"Polishes and mixes dialogue, sound effects, and music for films and dramas to create sound that fits the picture.","tasks":["Decide the direction of sound design","Correct dialogue and remove noise","Add sound effects and background music","Operate and maintain sound equipment"],"msActions":["Record everyday sounds with a phone recording app and make a sound diary","Reduce noise in your recordings with a free audio editing program","Watch a movie scene without sound, then watch it again with sound and notice the difference"]},
