  "cn-1433": {"name":"Inventor","summary":"Comes up with technology or objects that did not exist before, builds prototypes, and protects them with patents.","tasks":["Coming up with new ideas","Building prototypes","Filing patent applications","Selling patents and turning them into products"],"msActions":["Keep an invention idea notebook of everyday problems","Join an invention class or invention camp","Make a simple household item from recycled materials"]},
