  "cn-108": {"name":"Printing Press Operator","summary":"Operates printing presses to produce printed items such as books, newspapers, and pamphlets.","tasks":["Set up and operate printing presses","Mix ink and correct colors","Check the condition of printed items"],"msActions":["Join a printing workshop or a letterpress printing experience","Make a school newsletter or poster and look at how color and text are laid out","Find and read introductory materials about a local print shop or a printing museum"]},
  "cn-109": {"name":"Automotive Mechanic","summary":"Inspects cars, finds what is broken, and repairs or modifies them.","tasks":["Check the condition of vehicles","Diagnose and test faults","Repair, service, and tune vehicles"],"msActions":["Join a car repair experience program","Inspect and oil a bicycle yourself to learn what each part does","Find videos or books about how cars are built and about electric vehicle technology"]},
