  "cn-1061": {"name":"Member of Parliament","summary":"Represents the people in the National Assembly by making and revising laws and reviewing the government budget.","tasks":["Vote on making and revising laws","Review and approve the government budget","Speak for the people's opinions"],"msActions":["Gather opinions in a class meeting or student council and set rules","Look into youth activities such as mock assemblies and contests for law proposals","Pick a social problem and think about laws and policies to solve it"]},
