  "cn-10060": {"name":"Dog Therapist","summary":"Keeps dogs healthy in body and mind through massage and care.","tasks":["Advise on ways to stay healthy","Improve physical condition with massage and stimulation","Remove odors and disinfect with aromatherapy"],"msActions":["Observe a pet's behavior and record its condition","Write down the right way to treat animals","Find out whether a dog therapist career experience program exists"]},
  "cn-10061": {"name":"Genetic Counselor","summary":"Counsels and informs patients with genetic diseases and their families so they understand the illness and cope with it.","tasks":["Analyze family trees","Confirm diseases with genetic tests","Counsel patients and families"],"msActions":["Look into the similarities in your family to learn what heredity is","Find out whether a life science career experience program exists","Watch a genetic counselor video and summarize the work"]},
  "cn-10062": {"name":"Learning Disability Nurse","summary":"Cares for people with learning (developmental) disabilities so they can keep up daily life, and helps them get the treatment they need.","tasks":["Assess and judge patients' conditions","Support daily living skills training","Counsel families and caregivers"],"msActions":["Join a disability awareness class or volunteer activity to learn about different kinds of difficulties","Find a nurse experience program at a local career experience support center","Think about what help a person who needs care might need, and write about it"]},
  "cn-10063": {"name":"Private Detective","summary":"Investigates the facts of cases and accidents, and gathers and analyzes information.","tasks":["Collect and analyze information","Investigate the causes of and responsibility for accidents","Locate missing people and property"],"msActions":["Read a detective novel, sort out the clues, and map how the case unfolded","Look up career experience programs about investigation","Debate why personal information must be protected"]},
  "cn-10064": {"name":"Forensic Science Investigator","summary":"Collects and analyzes evidence from crime scenes to find out how a crime happened.","tasks":["Collect and analyze evidence","Reconstruct crime scenes","Recover digital evidence"],"msActions":["Look up career experience programs for forensic science investigators","Observe and compare how fingerprints differ from person to person","Do a science experiment and record your observations carefully"]},
  "cn-10065": {"name":"Outdoor Activity Instructor","summary":"Teaches leisure sports so people can enjoy them safely, and guides outdoor activities.","tasks":["Teach leisure sports","Guide and support outdoor activities","Install and manage safety facilities"],"msActions":["Join a local outdoor activity and learn its safety rules","Lead your friends in a simple activity in a club","Research how activities in nature affect body and mind"]},
  "cn-10066": {"name":"Sports Statistics Analyst","summary":"Organizes game records into numbers and analyzes them to understand the strategies of teams and players.","tasks":["Collect and organize game records","Analyze opposing teams' strength","Develop record systems and analysis methods"],"msActions":["Put the records of a game you like into a table and turn them into a graph","Watch a game and make a guess about which numbers affect winning or losing","Watch a mentoring video to learn about sports analysis work"]},
