  "cn-10071": {"name":"Animal Wrangler","summary":"Finds and trains animals for movies and ads, and guides them to perform during filming.","tasks":["Find animals to appear on screen","Train animals","Direct animals on the set"],"msActions":["Observe and record the behavior of a pet or a zoo animal","Find books or videos about animal training methods","Look up career experience programs for animal wranglers"]},
  "cn-10073": {"name":"Aquarist","summary":"Raises and observes aquatic animals in an aquarium and creates an environment where they stay healthy.","tasks":["Set up the aquarium environment","Observe aquatic animals and manage their feeding","Prevent disease and research information"],"msActions":["Observe and record how fish behave and react to food in a fish tank at home or school","Visit an aquarium and look at how its environment is set up","Look up career experience programs for aquarists"]},
