  "cn-10078": {"name":"International Development Cooperation Specialist","summary":"Plans international cooperation projects that support developing countries and manages their progress.","tasks":["Plan cooperation projects","Identify the needs of each country","Manage and monitor progress"],"msActions":["Find and read news about world issues and the hardships of developing countries, and summarize it","Join a volunteer activity and share what you felt","Look up career experience programs for international development cooperation specialists"]},
