  "cn-10110": {"name":"Quantum Computing Technician","summary":"Develops and operates quantum computers that use quantum physics to calculate faster than conventional computers.","tasks":["Develop quantum computer hardware","Design quantum algorithms","Test and improve performance"],"msActions":["Try finding easy materials on how quantum computers differ from regular computers and summarizing them","Look into career experience events at universities or research institutes working on quantum technology","Try making a simple calculation program through coding games"]},
